---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CaseHeader from '../../components/CaseHeader.astro';
import {projectRecords} from '../../data/portfolio';
const title='Koranco Farms — Connected farm records | Stephen Mensah';
const description=projectRecords.koranco.summary;
const structuredData={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'CreativeWork',name:'Koranco Farms MVP',description,url:new URL('/work/koranco/',Astro.site).href,author:{'@type':'Person',name:'Stephen Mensah'}};
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {structuredData} ogType="article"><article><CaseHeader id="koranco" sections={[{id:'built',label:'Documented scope'},{id:'evidence',label:'Result & limits'}]}/><div class="page-shell"><section id="built" class="case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Documented scope</p><h2 id="koranco-built-title">People, presence<br />and produce.</h2></div><div class="case-section__body"><p><span id="koranco-context-title"></span>The supplied project record describes a six-week engagement to understand how farm production data was captured, organized and used, then build a management MVP around three practical record types.</p><div class="module-list"><div><span>01</span><h3>Attendance</h3><p>Capture worker presence.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Produce</h3><p>Organize production records.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Employees</h3><p>Maintain worker information.</p></div></div><p>The module map above represents this documented scope. It is a conceptual artifact, not reconstructed application UI.</p></div></section><section id="evidence" class="case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Result & limits</p><h2 id="koranco-verified-title">A reported MVP.<br />A bounded account.</h2></div><div class="case-section__body"><p>{projectRecords.koranco.result}</p><aside class="boundary"><p>{projectRecords.koranco.boundary}</p><p>No farm-side production deployment, adoption, public repository or measured operational outcome is claimed.</p></aside></div></section><a class="next-project" href="/work/syncareer/"><span><span class="eyebrow">Next project</span><strong>Syncareer</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article></BaseLayout>
<style>.module-list>div{padding-block:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);display:grid;grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr;gap:.5rem 1rem}.module-list>div>span{color:var(--color-accent-text);font-size:.75rem}.module-list p{grid-column:2}</style>
